{"id":71340,"date":"2026-10-29T19:30:34","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:30:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71340"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:32:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:32:02","slug":"canicross-almoster","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/canicross-almoster\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00ba Canicross de Almoster 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00ba Canicross de Almoster 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>2\u00ba Canicross de Almoster 2027<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>27 e 28 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado e Domingo), na localidade de <strong>Alforzemel<\/strong>, freguesia de <strong>Almoster<\/strong>, no concelho e distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Integrada como a <strong>4\u00aa Etapa da Ta\u00e7a de Portugal de Mushing 2026\/2027<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o decorre ao longo de dois dias em trilhos de mato e caminhos rurais de terra batida.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o principal disputa-se em duas mangas (s\u00e1bado \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong> e domingo \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>) num circuito de cerca de <strong>5 km<\/strong> nas modalidades de <strong>Canicross<\/strong>, <strong>Bikejoring<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico), <strong>Scooterjoring DS2<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico) e <strong>Triciclo DR4<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico). No domingo de manh\u00e3 realizam-se tamb\u00e9m os escal\u00f5es de <strong>Canicross Infantil<\/strong> (<strong>1.200 m<\/strong> dos 11 aos 16 anos e <strong>450 m<\/strong> dos 6 aos 10 anos) e, \u00e0s <strong>11:00<\/strong>, a <strong>C\u00e3ominhada \/ Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 5 km<\/strong> (com ou sem c\u00e3o), que angaria donativos em g\u00e9nero a favor da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Amigos dos Animais de Rio Maior<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>CSCD de Alforzemel<\/strong> com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Santar\u00e9m<\/strong> e da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Almoster<\/strong>, a prova inclui controlo e assist\u00eancia veterin\u00e1ria (Dra. In\u00eas Lameiras), t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal, cronometragem, seguro desportivo e zonas para pernoita\/camping junto ao CSCD de Alforzemel. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"disp