; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Canicross Infantil (11-16 anos: 1,2 km | 6-10 anos: 450 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 28 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 7,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">C\u00e3ominhada \/ Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (~5 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 28 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Solid\u00e1ria:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/02\/2027 (+ donativo de ra\u00e7\u00e3o\/mantas))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 2\u00ba Canicross de Almoster 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no fim de semana de 27 e 28 de Fevereiro de 2027 (S\u00e1bado e Domingo), em Alforzemel, na freguesia de Almoster, concelho de Santar\u00e9m, constituindo a 4\u00aa Etapa da Ta\u00e7a de Portugal de Mushing 2026\/2027.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e as modalidades do programa de s\u00e1bado e domingo?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado (27\/02), o controlo veterin\u00e1rio e secretariado abrem \u00e0s 14:30, o briefing realiza-se \u00e0s 15:45 e as provas competitivas (1\u00aa manga de ~5 km: Triciclo DR4, Scooterjoring DS2, Bikejoring e Canicross) t\u00eam in\u00edcio \u00e0s 16:00. No domingo (28\/02), o briefing decorre \u00e0s 08:00, a 2\u00aa manga competitiva e o Canicross Infantil (450 m e 1.200 m) come\u00e7am \u00e0s 08:30, e a C\u00e3ominhada\/Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 5 km parte \u00e0s 11:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e a que associa\u00e7\u00e3o reverte a vertente solid\u00e1ria?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 14 de dezembro de 2026 a 23 de fevereiro de 2027 com os seguintes valores: 15,00 \u20ac nas modalidades competitivas (10,00 \u20ac por modalidade adicional), 7,50 \u20ac no Canicross Infantil e 5,00 \u20ac na C\u00e3ominhada\/Caminhada (acrescida de donativo em g\u00e9nero \u2014 ra\u00e7\u00e3o, mantas ou produtos \u2014 a favor da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Amigos dos Animais de Rio Maior).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos veterin\u00e1rios e equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio no Canicross?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os c\u00e3es em competi\u00e7\u00e3o devem ter pelo menos 18 meses (12 meses no escal\u00e3o infantil 6-10 anos), microchip, boletim de vacinas atualizado (raiva e polivalente obrigat\u00f3rias) e passar no controlo veterin\u00e1rio. No Canicross \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de arn\u00eas de tra\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o abrasivo, linha de tra\u00e7\u00e3o el\u00e1stica (1,5 m a 2,5 m) e cintur\u00e3o de corrida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o 2\u00ba Canicross de Almoster e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo CSCD de Alforzemel, com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Santar\u00e9m e da Freguesia de Almoster. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, cronometragem, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, brindes, seguro desportivo, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica e veterin\u00e1ria, existindo ainda servi\u00e7o de refei\u00e7\u00f5es por reserva e zona de pernoita\/camping.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"2\u00ba Canicross de Almoster 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-27\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"CSCD de Alforzemel, Alforzemel, Almoster, Santar\u00e9m\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 2\u00ba Canicross de Almoster 2027 realiza-se a 27 e 28 de fevereiro em Alforzemel, Santar\u00e9m. Canicross 5 km, Mushing e C\u00e3ominhada 5 km. Consulta e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-canicross-almoster.webp\"], \"offers\": [